# LSRD - Logical Shift Right D (opcode 0x04)

---
name: shifts right
memory: 04
setup: a=80 b=02
expect: a=40 b=01 N=0 Z=0 V=0 C=0
cycles: 1

---
name: sets carry and zero
memory: 04
setup: a=00 b=01
expect: a=00 b=00 C=1 Z=1 V=1
cycles: 1

---
name: shift with carry and non zero
memory: 04
setup: a=01 b=01
expect: a=00 b=80 C=1 V=1
cycles: 1
